                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b2a6a11-a5be-3484-8861-4509a25bf7e1",
                        "entry_id": "8516791c-5bb5-36ec-a341-8b7989a1dbb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "what a ..."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d7c59fb-729d-4f9a-b35b-e910bedf41c1",
                                "sense_id": "6b2a6a11-a5be-3484-8861-4509a25bf7e1",
                                "text": "— Э́кая морска́я каю́та, — закрича́л он, входя́, — всегда́ лбом сту́каюсь; то́же ведь кварти́рой называ́ется! А ты, брат, очну́лся? Сейча́с от Па́шеньки слы́шал.",
                                "translation": "\"What a cabin it is!\" he cried. \"I am always knocking my head. You call this a lodging! So you are conscious, brother? I've just heard the news from Pashenka.\"",
                                "english": "\"What a cabin it is!\" he cried. \"I am always knocking my head. You call this a lodging! So you are conscious, brother? I've just heard the news from Pashenka.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
